                                   #00f0ff cyan   → .primary   Color.TS.accent
                                   #10b981 green  → .success   Color.TS.statusSuccess
                                   #f59e0b amber  → .warning   Color.TS.statusWarning
                                   #8b5cf6 violet → .highlight Color.TS.chartSeriesPower
  lucide Zap/Car/Settings/Check→ SF Symbols bolt.fill / car.fill / gearshape.fill / checkmark.circle.fill
  lucide X / ChevronRight      → SF Symbols xmark / chevron.right
  indicator dots               → OnboardingWizardIndicatorRow + Capsule (complete=accent, active wider+glow;
                                   web `i<=currentStep` ⇒ isComplete, `i===currentStep` ⇒ isActive)
  Next vs Get Started          → OnboardingWizardPrimaryAction .advance/.finish (web `currentStep<length-1`)
