  backdrop click / Esc         → OnboardingWizardBackdrop tap-to-dismiss scrim + ✕ .keyboardShortcut(.cancelAction)
  localStorage + broadcast     → OnboardingWizardStore seam (P1/S8): UserDefaultsOnboardingWizardStore =
